    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly for math, but I used AI tools like chatbots to clarify coding concepts (my fav subject). While they’re useful for quick explanations, I prefer hands-on exploration. For math, I’d trust them more if paired with human guidance—like explaining a problem aloud.",
